OL,3,GNEWSAHIV charity has 'sensitive' health
OL,4,Adata stolen
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople using an HIV charity have been
OL,7,Ftold their "sensitive and personal"
OL,8,Fhealth information may have been stolen
OL,9,Fin a data breach.
OL,11,FIn an email sent to George House Trust
OL,12,Fusers and seen by the BBC, the
OL,13,FManchester-based organisation said the
OL,14,Fmaterial had been downloaded by hackers
OL,15,Fbut not published.
OL,17,FThe breach is part of a wider cyber
OL,18,Fsecurity incident potentially affecting
OL,19,Fup to 1,500 charities across the UK.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
